### 3. **Copy-paste duplication in special-poop handling** ✓ CONFIRMED
**Location:** Lines 1294-1305 in GameScene.ts

Three nearly-identical blocks:
```typescript
[...this.goldPoops.children.entries].forEach(obj => {
  const sp = obj as GoldPoop;
